WEBVTT

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.170
Ahiru no Sora

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:25.290
Nanairo no niji ga umareta asa 
The morning yields a rainbow of seven colors

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.830
Tori tachi wa hane o hirogete yuku
The birds all spread their wings wide

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.460
Kotae nante doko ni mo nai kara sa
There are no answers to be found anywhere

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.210
Sore o egaki ni yukou
So let's go and create them

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.000
Feel it

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.420
Feel it

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:46.630
Utsukushiki hane o motsu kimi wa
You have beautiful wings of your own

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.420
Taiyou o mezashi tobu no darou
And you will use them to fly up to the sun

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.920
Matataki no sono shunkan ni sekai o
For that one sparkling moment

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.210
Kaeru koto mo dekiru to shinjite
Believe that you can change even the world itself

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:05.170
Bokura wa toumei na kokoro de umareta hazu sa
We were surely born with transparent hearts

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:09.830
Yogoreta kutsu de habatakunda
Using our dirty shoes we will take flight

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:12.210
Arch o egaku youni
Drawing an arch in the air

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:19.580
Ashita no sora ga kieteshimau sono mae ni
Before the sky of tomorrow disappears completely

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:26.540
Kanashimi no yoru o koete umarekawarunda
Pass through a night of sorrow and be reborn

